{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waxwing</strong> is a co-op 2D sidescrolling flying game where you and a partner shoot attracting flames to guide the hero through a series of harrowing challenges \u2014 but beware getting too close to the fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Influence, Not Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/3c83e2f97ab8c1105cda855cbd388c7c.poster.avif?t=1758503135\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/3c83e2f97ab8c1105cda855cbd388c7c.webm?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/3c83e2f97ab8c1105cda855cbd388c7c.mp4?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waxwing features a unique movement mechanic \u2014 you and your partner are not the hero themself, but instead the force that guides them. Fire flames to create guideposts that move the hero through the level and away from obstacles en route. But be careful \u2014 if they actually touch the flames, it's instant death and an automatic reset of the level. Establish a back-and-forth firing pattern with your partner in short, fast-paced levels.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursue the Sun Across Lifetimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/f2f551f455252012882816fbcac9760f.poster.avif?t=1758503135\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/f2f551f455252012882816fbcac9760f.webm?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/f2f551f455252012882816fbcac9760f.mp4?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the hero\u2019s four lifetimes, each with their own theming, art, and enemies. Wind the hero\u2019s way through spiderwebs, barking teens, and black holes. Collect stars and confront the sun. One mistake and you\u2019re dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Take on Classic Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/77b9a73384b4692015573eeea278a237.poster.avif?t=1758503135\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/77b9a73384b4692015573eeea278a237.webm?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/77b9a73384b4692015573eeea278a237.mp4?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waxwing combines unexpected genre elements \u2014 the tight corridors and rapid respawning of precision platformers, the evasive maneuvers of bullet hell shoot \u2018em ups, the constant motion of endless runners, and even a \u201cclick-to-move\u201d control scheme reminiscent of CRPGs and RTS \u2014 to form a surprisingly intuitive and fresh angle on challenge, movement, and cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S. \u2014 Play In Person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A permanent arcade cabinet of Waxwing with custom lightgun controls exists at Wonderville in Brooklyn, NY!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328210?t=1758503135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/9ec0a53ded16c0eb753127fe5669b25a9a0a2ef9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758503135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/2b55415bc864d1265dd250a9216ed91ef5d0346c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758503135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/2b55415bc864d1265dd250a9216ed91ef5d0346c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758503135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waxwing</strong> is a co-op 2D sidescrolling flying game where you and a partner shoot attracting flames to guide the hero through a series of harrowing challenges \u2014 but beware getting too close to the fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Influence, Not Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/3c83e2f97ab8c1105cda855cbd388c7c.poster.avif?t=1758503135\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/3c83e2f97ab8c1105cda855cbd388c7c.webm?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/3c83e2f97ab8c1105cda855cbd388c7c.mp4?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waxwing features a unique movement mechanic \u2014 you and your partner are not the hero themself, but instead the force that guides them. Fire flames to create guideposts that move the hero through the level and away from obstacles en route. But be careful \u2014 if they actually touch the flames, it's instant death and an automatic reset of the level. Establish a back-and-forth firing pattern with your partner in short, fast-paced levels.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pursue the Sun Across Lifetimes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/f2f551f455252012882816fbcac9760f.poster.avif?t=1758503135\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/f2f551f455252012882816fbcac9760f.webm?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/f2f551f455252012882816fbcac9760f.mp4?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the hero\u2019s four lifetimes, each with their own theming, art, and enemies. Wind the hero\u2019s way through spiderwebs, barking teens, and black holes. Collect stars and confront the sun. One mistake and you\u2019re dead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Take on Classic Elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/77b9a73384b4692015573eeea278a237.poster.avif?t=1758503135\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/77b9a73384b4692015573eeea278a237.webm?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/extras/77b9a73384b4692015573eeea278a237.mp4?t=1758503135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waxwing combines unexpected genre elements \u2014 the tight corridors and rapid respawning of precision platformers, the evasive maneuvers of bullet hell shoot \u2018em ups, the constant motion of endless runners, and even a \u201cclick-to-move\u201d control scheme reminiscent of CRPGs and RTS \u2014 to form a surprisingly intuitive and fresh angle on challenge, movement, and cooperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P.S. \u2014 Play In Person</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A permanent arcade cabinet of Waxwing with custom lightgun controls exists at Wonderville in Brooklyn, NY!</p>","developers":["Common Opera"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/99ead1db9d8ddb7fb170962ee59044708e81fdc7/header.jpg?t=1758503135","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3328210/1443545259/4909847df0d382d6128b3b296f1c8d97ec203572/1756927802/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758135350","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3328210/1443545259/4909847df0d382d6128b3b296f1c8d97ec203572/1756927802/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758135350","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3328210/1443545259/4909847df0d382d6128b3b296f1c8d97ec203572/1756927802/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758135350","id":257192792,"name":"Waxwing Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192792/991a1082ddfd809033dd1782c892a9d2638ee63a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758135350"}],"name":"Waxwing","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 | AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTS 250 | AMD Radeon HD 6670</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / Radeon HD 5750 or better</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Common Opera"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nDrogas l\u00edcitas\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nGewalt\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cSince the dawn of time, humans played games with other humans, competing, cooperating or just sharing good time together. [...] This game challenges you to collaborate [...] by taking turns on rhythm to guide a character to the goal without hitting dangers. [...] Super easy to pick up and play by anyone, guaranteeing fun time for players of all ages.\u201d<br>Shuhei Yoshida<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/a9a40a9230dfe41eae53b09219a1905d851184cf/ss_a9a40a9230dfe41eae53b09219a1905d851184cf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758503135","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328210/a9a40a9230dfe41eae53b09219a1905d851184cf/ss_a9a40a9230dfe41eae53b09219a1905d851184cf.600x338.jpg?t=1758503135"},{"